.TH GOOT.INI 5 "2026-11-22" "Goot 0.2.0" "File Formats Manual"
.SH NAME
goot.ini \- configuration file for Goot native Wayland terminal emulator
.SH SYNOPSIS
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/goot/goot.ini
.br
.I ~/.config/goot/goot.ini
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B goot
reads its configuration from
.I goot.ini
(falling back to
.I goot.toml
if present). All sections and keys are optional.
.SH SECTIONS
.TP
.B [main]
.BR font ,
.BR size ,
.BR line-spacing ,
.BR pad ,
.BR title .
.TP
.B [window]
.BR initial-cols ,
.BR initial-rows ,
.BR decorations
(auto, server, client, or none),
.BR title-bar
(true or false),
.BR title-bar-height
(integer pixels, default 28).
.TP
.B [scrollback]
.B lines
(bounded integer 0..100000, default 4000).
.TP
.B [cursor]
.B style
(block, underline, or beam).
.TP
.B [touch]
.B long-press-delay
(milliseconds to hold before drag becomes selection, default 400).
.TP
.B [url]
.B label-letters
(characters used to generate URL jump labels, default sadfjklewcmpgh).
.TP
.B [colors]
.BR background ,
.BR foreground ,
.BR cursor ,
.BR selection-background ,
.BR selection-foreground ,
.BR regular0..7 ,
.BR bright0..7 .
.TP
.B [security]
.B allow-osc52
(default false).
.SH DEFAULT SHORTCUTS
.SS Normal mode
.IP \(bu 2
\fBShift+PageUp / Shift+PageDown\fR: Scroll up/down in history
.IP \(bu 2
\fBCtrl+Shift+C, XF86Copy\fR: Copy selection to clipboard
.IP \(bu 2
\fBCtrl+Shift+V, XF86Paste\fR: Paste from clipboard
.IP \(bu 2
\fBShift+Insert\fR: Paste from primary selection
.IP \(bu 2
\fBCtrl+Shift+R\fR: Start scrollback search
.IP \(bu 2
\fBCtrl++, Ctrl+=\fR / \fBCtrl+-\fR / \fBCtrl+0\fR: Increase, decrease, reset font size
.IP \(bu 2
\fBCtrl+Shift+N\fR: Spawn a new Goot terminal (honors OSC 7 CWD)
.IP \(bu 2
\fBCtrl+Shift+O\fR: Enter URL mode
.IP \(bu 2
\fBCtrl+Shift+U\fR: Enter Unicode input mode
.IP \(bu 2
\fBCtrl+Shift+Z / Ctrl+Shift+X\fR: Jump to previous/next prompt (requires OSC 133;A)
.SS Scrollback search mode
.IP \(bu 2
\fBCtrl+R / Ctrl+S\fR: Search backward/forward for next match
.IP \(bu 2
\fBCtrl+W / Ctrl+Shift+W\fR: Extend selection/query to word boundary or whitespace
.IP \(bu 2
\fBCtrl+V, Ctrl+Shift+V, Ctrl+Y, XF86Paste\fR: Paste clipboard into search buffer
.IP \(bu 2
\fBShift+Insert\fR: Paste primary selection into search buffer
.IP \(bu 2
\fBEscape, Ctrl+G\fR: Cancel search; \fBReturn\fR: Finish and copy match to primary selection
.SS URL mode
.IP \(bu 2
\fBt\fR: Toggle showing URL inside jump label
.IP \(bu 2
\fBEscape, Ctrl+C, Ctrl+G, Ctrl+D\fR: Exit URL mode
.SS Mouse & Touchscreen
.IP \(bu 2
\fBLeft single/double/triple/quad-click\fR: Char/block (Ctrl), word/whitespace (Ctrl), quotes/row, entire row; \fBShift\fR overrides client mouse tracking
.IP \(bu 2
\fBMiddle\fR: Paste primary selection; \fBRight / Ctrl+Right\fR: Extend selection (character-wise with Ctrl)
.IP \(bu 2
\fBWheel / Ctrl+Wheel\fR: Scroll history / zoom font
.IP \(bu 2
\fBTouch tap / drag / long-press+drag\fR: Left click / scroll history / text selection
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR goot (1)
